# Iron Linux Raspberry Pi 4 ARM64 - desktop packages
#
# Keep this aligned with the amd64 Iron desktop stack where packages are
# architecture-independent.

## --- Compositor ---
labwc
xwayland
wayland-utils
wlr-randr

## --- Session login ---
greetd
gtkgreet

## --- Authentication agent ---
polkitd
pkexec
lxpolkit

## --- Panel / launcher ---
waybar
fuzzel

## --- Notifications ---
mako-notifier

## --- Terminal ---
foot

## --- File manager + removable media ---
pcmanfm
gvfs
udiskie

## --- Boot splash ---
plymouth
plymouth-label

## --- Wallpaper / lock screen / power menu ---
swaybg
swayidle
swaylock
wlogout

## --- Screenshots + clipboard ---
grim
slurp
wl-clipboard
cliphist

## --- Audio: PipeWire + WirePlumber stack ---
pipewire
pipewire-pulse
pipewire-alsa
wireplumber
wob

## --- Networking ---
network-manager
network-manager-applet

## --- Bluetooth ---
bluez
blueman

## --- Input / hardware controls ---
brightnessctl

## --- System helpers & scripting ---
python3-gi

## --- Fonts & Themes ---
fonts-inter
fonts-jetbrains-mono
fonts-noto-color-emoji
hicolor-icon-theme
